All three summaries record source-only generation,48 parsed/syntax-valid outputs and EOS48. The every2 arm has one duplicate; the others zero. The saved results contain18 fits; every selected epoch is0. The artifact records `training_executed=true`, but `qualified`, `admitted`, `checkpoint_promoted`, `fresh_holdout`, `source_semantics_verified`, `convergence_proven` and `proof_authority` are false.

These results concern repeatedly exposed authored development paragraphs, not fresh legal gold. The same48 examples recur across width/seed arms; aggregate scores over288 presentations are not288 independent cases. Fixed340 updates and differing auxiliary cadence are not an equal-wall-time convergence comparison. The faster every2 arm changes supervision exposure as well as cost.

The historical zero-ready768 preparation and earlier0/48 fits remain valid within their original selections. They cannot support a claim that no768D training happened later. This saved metadata read is not an independent neural/optimizer reproduction or current-source checkpoint admission.

The revised plan must investigate both learning and selection: strong private final candidates coexist with epoch0 selection because unchanged nonregression gates reject extra whole rules. Do not discard the gate or silently promote candidates; preserve strict acceptance and separately analyze the complete coverage/error/cost frontier.

### Source-head follow-up: stronger candidates and an important lifecycle failure

The [source-head training guide](/home/barberb/lift_coding/external/ipfs_datasets/docs/autoencoders/source_head_training.md:327) records a later matched comparison. Direct inspection of its [saved results](/home/barberb/lift_coding/external/ipfs_datasets/docs/implementation/reports/evidence/decoder-source-head-lr-20261003/results.json) confirms2328474 bytes / SHA-256 `1be4ee7a7caac9551d738be3b609664e07325eab02882d823c7719d18f549a0a`. The [manifest](/home/barberb/lift_coding/external/ipfs_datasets/docs/implementation/reports/evidence/decoder-source-head-lr-20261003/manifest.json) is545606 bytes / `cb65058088900611c3eb6e599a08a0db32f3fba59643d87368ddaba2b288148d`.

| Final LR10 candidate | Exact /48 | Extra / missing | Selected epoch | Selected exact /48 |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
|384D /1729|47|1 /1|0|0|
|384D /2718|47|1 /1|0|0|
|768D /1729|46|2 /2|0|0|
|768D /2718|45|3 /3|52|14|

All final candidate panels above have48 syntax-valid outputs. The selected768D/2718 state instead has17 syntax-valid outputs,19 generated rules and161 missing rules. Thus the all-epoch0 statement belongs to the preceding18-fit generated-field study, not every later run.

The guide reports perfect raw field readouts in the four larger-width candidates but remaining generated `approve`/`examine` substitutions. A readout can therefore contain the correct answer while the recurrent/prefix-conditioned output path fails. That supports investigating the readout-to-generation boundary; it does not prove which contribution causes the substitutions.

For one training-only8D diagnostic,113 distinct transformed vectors had no contradictory-label collision groups. Nearby vectors and limited head capacity/optimization remain issues; the observations do not prove that8D inevitably loses those labels. The standalone probe has9.5625 times the clause exposure of the full decoder at the same update count. Its learning-rate change also changes decoupled AdamW shrinkage, so it is not an isolated gradient-scale intervention.

The saved result records `training_executed=true`, `guardian_succeeded=false`, and `resource_receipt_reconciled_after_guardian_failure=true`; qualification, fresh-holdout, promotion, convergence, semantics and proof flags remain false. The guide describes a numerical child exit0 followed by guardian exit1 during scheduler release. Read-only reconciliation found released disk accounting and no remaining lease, but did not reconstruct continuous coverage or rewrite the failure. Preserve this as a separate readiness gate for any unattended continuation.

This is saved historical metadata inspection, not new neural execution or resource reconciliation. The fair baseline set includes these stronger unpromoted attempts and their failures, rather than stopping at0/48 or42/48.
